WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:12.059
Welcome to DigiVote. It helps you identify and support leaders in your own area: Parliament, Assembly, Gram Panchayat and Urban Ward.

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:17.200
It is a pre-poll survey, at least a month before the elections.

00:00:17.512 --> 00:00:23.451
It is open to every voter aged 18 and above with a valid Voter ID.

00:00:24.318 --> 00:00:31.387
Getting started is easy. Log in with your mobile number, and tap Send OTP.

00:00:32.254 --> 00:00:37.320
Enter the OTP from the SMS, and tap Verify OTP.

00:00:38.186 --> 00:00:44.522
Next time, just tap Login with Face ID, or use OTP as a backup.

00:00:45.388 --> 00:00:51.957
DigiVote is open to every voter aged 18 or above with a valid Voter ID.

00:00:52.268 --> 00:01:02.509
First time users fill in name, age group and gender, and pick their State, Parliament, Assembly, and Gram Panchayat or Urban Ward.

00:01:03.376 --> 00:01:09.791
Review your details, like Medak Parliament and Patancheru Assembly, and submit.

00:01:10.658 --> 00:01:15.932
From Account, you can edit your profile and Candidate Card anytime.

00:01:16.798 --> 00:01:28.420
On Home, Poll Info shows your poll schedule: nomination, ballot and results dates for each seat, like Medak, Patancheru and Tellapur 263.

00:01:28.731 --> 00:01:32.021
A green dot marks the open stage.

00:01:32.888 --> 00:01:36.614
Insights gives a quick overview of the activity.

00:01:37.481 --> 00:01:41.104
And My Constituencies shows your own areas.

00:01:41.971 --> 00:01:51.626
Want to lead your area? Open Nomination and pick the seat you want to contest. You can nominate for one seat only.

00:01:52.493 --> 00:01:59.090
Add your photo and a Candidate Card that voters can read, then tap Review and Submit.

00:01:59.956 --> 00:02:04.945
When the ballot opens, see every candidate for your constituency.

00:02:05.256 --> 00:02:12.401
Tap a candidate to see their Candidate Card. Use the circle to choose, then submit.

00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:22.410
Finally, Results shows the votes for every candidate, seat by seat, and which local leaders your community is backing.

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:33.094
Spread the word. Tap Invite on WhatsApp to invite your close friends and family, so they can take part in the elections for their own area.

00:02:33.961 --> 00:02:39.700
Or choose from contacts, or share by SMS, Email or Telegram.

00:02:40.566 --> 00:02:44.574
Then track who has joined, and remind the others.

00:02:45.441 --> 00:02:58.633
That is DigiVote. A pre-poll survey, a month before elections, to back leaders in your own area. Download it today, and invite your family on WhatsApp!
